Notes
-----
* Architecture mirrors the approved sibling admin W7 ports (ApiLogsPage, FeedbackQueuePage):
  a UI-free Model/Source/ViewModel projection + a thin WinUI view, so every branch is unit-
  tested headlessly. The view-model reads through ISlowQueriesFeed; the generated-client feed
  (SlowQueriesClientFeed) binds the OpenAPI contract client (ADR-004) and is request-shape +
  envelope + 503 verified. The shell registers the page on the default (empty-feed) ctor exactly
  as ApiLogs/FeedbackQueue do.
* SI / units: the page renders pg_stat_statements counters/timings already in their native units
  (calls, ms, rows, %); no unit conversion applies. Numbers format at the display boundary via
  NumberFormatting (the web fmtNumber port).
* Strings are added to the platform catalog Strings/{en,ar,he}/Resources.resw (the W7 allowed
  file). The web SlowQueriesPage uses inline t(key, default) defaults (no web/src/i18n entries),
  so the values are ported verbatim from those inline defaults. ar/he are placeholder locales
  carrying the English fallback (matching the generator's materialized fallback rows).
* Pre-existing blocker repaired: TeslaSync.App.Tests.csproj was committed with merge=union
  corruption (multiple <Project> roots, MSB4025). Regenerated to the single canonical root per
  the file's own invariant — the Include-deduplicated, case-insensitive ordinal path-sorted union
  of every Microsoft.UI-free .cs under dashboard-widgets/ feature-views/ misc-surfaces/
  modals-dialogs/ shared-surfaces/ widget-primitives/ (1327 existing + 3 new SlowQueries = 1330),
  verified to reproduce every prior entry verbatim with 0 drops + 0 duplicates.

